'''Wild Doge''' (野生のわんこ, ''Yasei no Wanko'', '''Wild Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]].

